#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xinit.xml:88
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of xinit"
msgstr "Instalação do xinit"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xinit.xml:91
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>xinit</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>xinit</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xinit.xml:95
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure $XORG_CONFIG --with-xinitdir=/etc/X11/app-defaults &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure $XORG_CONFIG --with-xinitdir=/etc/X11/app-defaults &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xinit.xml:99
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xinit.xml:103
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xinit.xml:106
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"ldconfig</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"ldconfig</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xinit.xml:112
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If starting Xorg from the command line, the default instructions above start"
" Xorg on the current virtual terminal.  It may be convenient to see Xorg and"
" associated application messages on the current virtual terminal, normally "
"tty1, and start the graphical environment on the first available unused "
"virtual terminal, normally tty7.  To do this, set the suid bit on the Xorg "
"application as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se iniciar o &quot;Xorg&quot; a partir da linha de comando, [então] as "
"instruções padrão acima iniciarão o &quot;Xorg&quot; no terminal virtual "
"atual. Possivelmente seja conveniente ver as mensagens do &quot;Xorg&quot; e"
" do aplicativo associado no terminal virtual atual, normalmente "
"&quot;tty1&quot;, e iniciar o ambiente gráfico no primeiro terminal virtual "
"não usado disponível, normalmente &quot;tty7&quot;. Para fazer isso, "
"configure o bit &quot;suid&quot; no aplicativo &quot;Xorg&quot; como o(a) "
"usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xinit.xml:121
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>chmod u+s $XORG_PREFIX/bin/Xorg</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>chmod u+s $XORG_PREFIX/bin/Xorg</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xinit.xml:124
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"At this point you can start Xorg on virtual terminal 7 with <command>startx "
"&lt;client arguments&gt; -- vt7</command>.  Now you can toggle between tty1 "
"and tty7 with the Ctrl-Alt-F1 and Ctrl-Alt-F7 key combinations."
msgstr ""
"Neste ponto você consegue iniciar o &quot;Xorg&quot; no terminal virtual 7 "
"com &quot;<command>startx &lt;argumentos do cliente&gt; "
"--vt7</command>&quot;. Agora você pode alternar entre &quot;tty1&quot; e "
"&quot;tty7&quot; com as combinações de teclas &quot;Ctrl-Alt-F1&quot; e "
"&quot;Ctrl-Alt-F7&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xinit.xml:131
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To automatically start Xorg on the first available virtual terminal, modify "
"the <command>startx</command> script as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user with:"
msgstr ""
"Para iniciar automaticamente o &quot;Xorg&quot; no primeiro terminal virtual"
" disponível, modifique o conjunto de comandos sequenciais "
"&quot;<command>startx</command>&quot; como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem"
" class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot; com:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xinit.xml:136
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -i '/$serverargs $vtarg/ s/serverargs/: #&amp;/' "
"$XORG_PREFIX/bin/startx</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -i '/$serverargs $vtarg/ s/serverargs/: #&amp;/' "
"$XORG_PREFIX/bin/startx</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xinit.xml:139
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"After this change, the virtual terminal does not need to be specified on the"
" <command>startx</command> command line."
msgstr ""
"Depois dessa mudança, o terminal virtual não precisa ser especificado na "
"linha de comando do <command>startx</command>."

